---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalLanguageNotice from '../../components/LegalLanguageNotice';
import { sitePath, SITE_URL, SITE_HOST } from '../../lib/site';

const title = "Legal Notice | CourtSide Padel Retreats";
const description = "Legal notice and company information for CourtSide Padel Retreats, in compliance with LSSI-CE and UK consumer law.";
const canonical = sitePath('/legal/legal-notice');
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} hideLangToggle={true}>
  <main id="main-content" class="bg-white min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8">
      <LegalLanguageNotice client:load />

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-gold font-semibold mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-brand-dark tracking-wide mb-4">Legal Notice</h1>
      <p class="text-brand-dark/50 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: May 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-brand-dark/80 space-y-10">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Company information</h2>
          <p>In compliance with the UK Electronic Commerce Regulations 2002, the Spanish Ley de Servicios de la Sociedad de la Información y de Comercio Electrónico (LSSI-CE), and applicable EU regulations, the following information is disclosed:</p>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-2">
            <p><strong>Trading name:</strong> CourtSide Padel Retreats</p>
            <p><strong>Registered company name:</strong> Crtside Events Ltd</p>
            <p><strong>Company registration number:</strong> 16289087</p>
            <p><strong>Registered address:</strong> 24 Hendham Road, SW17 7DQ</p>
            <p><strong>VAT / Tax identification number:</strong> Pending registration</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:awatelet@cspadel.com" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">awatelet@cspadel.com</a></p>
            <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href={SITE_URL} class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">{SITE_HOST}</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Purpose of the website</h2>
          <p>This website provides information about CourtSide Padel Retreats' luxury padel retreat offering in Menorca, Spain, and facilitates booking enquiries.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>All content on this website — including but not limited to text, images, logos, videos, graphics, and design — is the property of CourtSide Padel Retreats or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Reproduction, distribution, public communication, or transformation of any content without the express written consent of CourtSide Padel Retreats is strictly prohibited.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Disclaimer of liability</h2>
          <p>CourtSide Padel Retreats makes reasonable efforts to ensure that the information on this website is accurate and up to date. However, we make no representations or warranties regarding the completeness, accuracy, or suitability of any information.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We accept no liability for any loss or damage arising from use of, or reliance on, the content of this website.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Links to third-party websites are provided for convenience only. We accept no responsibility for the content or practices of any external sites.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Applicable law</h2>
          <p>This website is operated from the United Kingdom. These legal notices are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Where applicable, we also comply with Spanish LSSI-CE requirements given the location of our retreat activities in Spain.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Dispute resolution</h2>
          <p>The European Commission's online dispute resolution (ODR) platform was discontinued on <strong>20 July 2025</strong> by Regulation (EU) 2024/3228 and is no longer available.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If you are a consumer in the EEA, you can find an approved alternative dispute resolution body through the Commission's <a href="https://consumer-redress.ec.europa.eu/list-alternative-dispute-resolution-adr-bodies_en" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">list of ADR bodies</a>, or through the European Consumer Centre in your country. Please raise any complaint with us first at <a href="mailto:awatelet@cspadel.com" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">awatelet@cspadel.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">Contact</h2>
          <p>For any queries relating to this Legal Notice:<br />
          <a href="mailto:awatelet@cspadel.com" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">awatelet@cspadel.com</a></p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
